{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位重點提要｜11月17日  \" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/MAG-PROMO-261117.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】國家主席習近平將與俄羅斯總統普京及美國總統特朗普在深圳APEC期間舉行歷史性三方會談，預料有甚麼關鍵議題？如何影響世界大局？</p><p>周二的《時事全方位》，請來專家分析。</p><p>題目：前瞻中俄美元首會晤</p><p>熱線電話：1833298</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T14:19:09.992007+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T13:38:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T01:39:39.242436+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T14:12:31.043511+00:00","content_hash":"f47231cd6dc49ee4a690798f631d777f8691c4f7297579a01bb98323b3665989","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}